WEBVTT

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:08.288
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Here is a standard deck of playing cards:

00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:20.686
52 cards, four suits – spades, clubs, diamonds, hearts – 12 picture cards, two jokers.

00:00:21.806 --> 00:00:24.749
Most people are familiar with these cards.

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:28.612
But what do they know about their history and their uses?

00:00:30.048 --> 00:00:36.802
The first playing cards originated in Asia, probably in China in the 9th century.

00:00:37.494 --> 00:00:43.028
Between the 9th and the 14th century, they traveled west across the world,

00:00:43.582 --> 00:00:47.885
through India, Persia, and Egypt, to Europe.

00:00:49.527 --> 00:00:53.480
The early cards looked different from the ones we know today

00:00:53.912 --> 00:00:56.880
and the suits were different in different countries,

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:03.301
for example, cups, swords, leaves, bells, and roses.

00:01:04.454 --> 00:01:11.411
The picture cards were all male figures, the king, the jack, and a soldier on a horse.

00:01:12.711 --> 00:01:20.276
From the 16th century, the French deck of 52 cards that we know today became the most common.

00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:24.930
Its design was simple and therefore cheap to print.

00:01:26.491 --> 00:01:28.415
Why are there 52 cards?

00:01:29.459 --> 00:01:33.111
And why four suits and twelve picture cards?

00:01:34.431 --> 00:01:39.840
No one knows for sure, but an interesting theory is that the

00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:48.996
52 cards represent the 52 weeks in a year, the four suits represent the four seasons:

00:01:49.335 --> 00:01:58.617
spring, summer, fall, and winter, and the 12 picture cards represent the 12 months of the year.

00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:02.438
The highest picture card is the king.

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:08.223
On the king card, the king always has a sword or an axe.

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:12.003
The kings also always have mustaches,

00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:16.674
except for the king of hearts, who sometimes doesn’t have one.

00:02:18.191 --> 00:02:21.161
The second highest picture card is the queen.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:27.084
The French introduced the queen instead of the soldier on a horse.

00:02:27.484 --> 00:02:32.104
On the queen card, the queen always has a flower in her hand.

00:02:32.805 --> 00:02:38.655
In English decks of cards, the jack was originally called the knave.

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:45.201
However, because the initials of the picture cards appear on the corner of each card,

00:02:45.225 --> 00:02:50.377
and there was already a “k” for “king,” "knave" became “jack.”

00:02:51.897 --> 00:02:55.984
The jokers were first added to the deck in the 1850s.

00:02:56.904 --> 00:02:59.519
They soon became a standard part of the deck,

00:02:59.966 --> 00:03:06.404
and in some games they are “wild cards,” that is, they can be any card.

00:03:06.977 --> 00:03:10.107
Playing cards quickly became very popular.

00:03:10.694 --> 00:03:15.057
This was because previously most games were for two players.

00:03:15.573 --> 00:03:19.417
Card games were ideal for a lot of numbers of players

00:03:19.798 --> 00:03:22.912
and were especially popular with women.

00:03:23.558 --> 00:03:31.841
The international 52-card deck is still very popular all over the world with people of all ages:

00:03:31.842 --> 00:03:39.294
easy children’s games, games for one person, and serious games, like bridge or canasta.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.630
But playing cards are not only for games.

00:03:44.697 --> 00:03:47.840
Although there are special fortune-telling card decks,

00:03:47.841 --> 00:03:53.815
like tarot cards, the standard deck was also a very popular way

00:03:53.998 --> 00:03:59.766
to tell people’s fortune in the 18th, 19th, and 20th centuries.

00:04:00.033 --> 00:04:06.469
The four suits represent four themes: spades are about challenges or difficulties,

00:04:08.275 --> 00:04:14.610
hearts are about feelings and relationships, clubs are about positive things,

00:04:15.937 --> 00:04:17.775
diamonds are about money.

00:04:18.903 --> 00:04:22.675
Each number and picture card also has a special meaning.

00:04:23.783 --> 00:04:28.395
You can have all kinds of fun with cards in many different ways.